<title>USA: American Eagle Aug same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>American Eagle Aug same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>WARRENDALE, Pa. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>			1996	 1995     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$31.0	$27.8    + 11.5	+ 8.0</p>
